# DotAIOS Codex Build — Audit Report

**Audited**: `/Users/filo/Brain/dotaios` (everything GPT 5.5/Codex created)  
**Compared against**: `aios-product-brief-v2.md` (our consolidated plan)

---

## Verdict: Solid Foundation, Well-Aligned ✅

GPT did a genuinely good job. The scaffold follows our plan closely, the code is clean and zero-dependency (no external npm packages needed at runtime for the core), and the smoke test passes end-to-end. No critical mistakes — but there are gaps and a few deviations worth flagging.

