## Where Codex Deviated from Plan (and whether it matters)

| Deviation | Impact | Verdict |
|-----------|--------|---------|
| Named the package `dotaios` instead of `aios` | Neutral — avoids npm name collision | ✅ Good call. Keep `dotaios`. |
| No `commander.js` — hand-rolled arg parsing | Neutral for now | ✅ Fine for 4 commands. Revisit if commands grow. |
| No `inquirer` — uses `readline` | Neutral | ✅ Actually better: zero deps for `npx`. |
| No `handlebars` — custom `render()` | Works but limited | ⚠️ Fine for now. The `{{#unless}}` gap is a latent bug if someone adds templates using it. |
| `FIRST_SESSION.md` — not in original plan | Positive addition | ✅ Great onboarding idea. Keep it. |
| `scripts/smoke.mjs` — not in original plan | Positive addition | ✅ Essential for CI. Keep it. |
| `examples/plugins/hello-memory/` — not in original plan | Positive addition | ✅ Helps plugin devs. Keep it. |

