2. Fix: Delete templates/aios.json.hbs (dead code)            [1 min]  
3. Fix: Remove "workspaces" from root package.json             [1 min]
4. Fix: Extract expandHome to @dotaios/core/paths.mjs          [10 min]
5. Run: pnpm install (generates lockfile)                       [2 min]
6. Git: Initial commit                                          [2 min]
7. Test: Run full smoke test one more time                      [1 min]
```

After that, you're at the end of **Day 1-2** of the plan. Day 3 work (agent file generation) is already done — Codex built the templates. Day 4 (`status` + `ingest`) is also done. So you're effectively at **Day 5-6** already.

**What's actually left for v1 release:**
